  "description": "Spacious newly renovated four-bedroom house to rent, just 5 minutes from Headford.\n\nThe house has been recently renovated throughout and has undergone a full energy upgrade, bringing it to a B energy rating.\n\nThe property has four double bedrooms, one of which is en-suite, as well as a newly fitted main family bathroom. There is a newly fitted kitchen and a large, bright sitting room.\n\nThe house will be fully furnished for move-in and comes with all mod cons. Fibre broadband has also been installed.\n\nHeating is oil-fired central heating, along with two solid-fuel stoves.\n\nOutside, there is a large south-facing rear garden with a generous lawn area.\n\nSituated in a quiet countryside setting, just a 5-minute drive from Headford and approximately 25 minutes from Galway City, with schools, shops and local amenities within easy reach.\n\nAvailable immediately.",
